    "sectionHeading": "Bippity Roo",
    "content": "Bippity Roo is a anthropromorphic moose. He owns a bakery in Rackwick City called Baked Bites. It's specialty is cheese sandwhiches. His best friend is Nollie. He has a wife and three kids. His wife's name is Janet Roo. His kids are Marigold Roo, Cressida Roo, and Mary Loo Roo.",
