    "sectionHeading": "Creation",
    "content": "On October 10, 1980 a dragon appeared in the sky over the city of Denver That Was. It fell and everything it encricled was transported to the Great Head. Everything within the dragon's circumference -- people and city became the seed of Rackwick City.",
